\t<h1 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">Cinema</h1>\t\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\" itemprop=\"text\">\n\t\t\t\n<h2 id=\"big-screen-entertainment-st-john-s\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Big screen entertainment @ St John&#8217;s</h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"here-are-the-cinema-dates-to-get-into-your-diaries\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Here are the cinema dates to get into your diaries.</h4>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"cinema-show-times\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cinema show times</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes mick\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Film</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>12th December 2026</td><td><a href=\"https://www.stjohnsshirley.org.uk/the-polar-express/\"><strong>Family Film </strong>&#8211; The Polar Express</a></td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>12th December 2026</td><td><a href=\"https://www.stjohnsshirley.org.uk/love-actually/\">Love Actually</a></td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>9th May 2026</td><td><strong>Family Film</strong> &#8211; Zootropolis 2</td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>9th May 2026</td><td>Downton Abbey: The Grand Finale</td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>14th December 2024</td><td><strong>Family Film &#8211; </strong>Arthur Christmas</td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>14th December 2024</td><td>Miracle on 34th Street</td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>16th December 2023</td><td><strong>Family Film </strong>&#8211; ELF</td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>10th June 2023</td><td><strong>Family Film </strong>&#8211; Matilda the Musical</td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>CANCELLED</td><td>The Banshees of Inisherin</td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>4th March 2023</td><td>Top Gun: Maverick</td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>4th March 2023</td><td><strong>Family Film</strong> &#8211; Zootropolis</td><td>3:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>15th October 2022</td><td>Downton Abbey &#8211; A new Era</td><td>7:30pm</td></tr><tr><td>15th October 2022</td><td><strong>Family Film</strong> &#8211; The Bad Guys</td><td>